<title>USA: Insignia Financial Group Inc Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Insignia Financial Group Inc Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.11		    $0.01</p>
<p> Net			  3,544			502</p>
<p> Revs			77,147		   36,233</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,909		   25,916</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.27		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net			  8,564		    5,806</p>
<p> Revs		     221,054		  123,032</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  31,561		   22,681</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 net earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization were $16.22 million, or $0.49 per share, versus $5.78 million, or $0.22 per share, in Q4 1995.</p>
<p>For the year, net earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization were $47.71 million, or $1.51 per share, versus $24.62 million, or $1.09 per share, in 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
